BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:62347b227f6806eb@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260730T221950Z
DTSTART:20260722T053000Z
DTEND:20260804T133000Z
SUMMARY:UNSUNG: Celebrating the Extraordinary Grandeur of Smallness
LOCATION:Art Gallery\, Kamaladevi Complex\, IIC\, India International Cen
 tre\, 40 Max Mueller Marg\, Lodhi Gardens\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://iicdelhi.in/programmes/exhibition-unsung-celebrating-extraord
 inary-grandeur-smallness
DESCRIPTION:A photography exhibition curated by Amit Mehra\, photographer
 \, curator\, and founder of the UNSUNG project\, an ongoing initiative th
 at celebrates the lives and contributions of extraordinary yet often over
 looked individuals.\nThe photographs explore the beauty and significance 
 of lives\, places\, and ideas that often go unnoticed. Through visual nar
 ratives by contemporary artists\, the exhibition reflects on ordinary peo
 ple and unseen worlds whose stories reveal resilience\, conviction\, and 
 human connection.\nThe exhibition will be inaugurated on Tuesday\, 21 Jul
 y’26 at 18:00 hrs by Amb Shyam Saran\, President\, IIC\nThe exhibition 
 will remain open daily from 11:00 to 19:00 hrs\n(Collaboration: Srishti M
 anipal Institute of Art\, Design and Technology (a constituent of MAHE\, 
 Manipal) and Manipal Academy of Higher Education (MAHE)\, Manipal (Instit
 ution of Eminence Deemed to be University)\n\nhttps://iicdelhi.in/program
 mes/exhibition-unsung-celebrating-extraordinary-grandeur-smallness
CATEGORIES:exhibition\,art\,photography
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:571e8403cd7afc39@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260730T221950Z
DTSTART:20260726T053000Z
DTEND:20260802T133000Z
SUMMARY:Flux of Being
LOCATION:Art Gallery\, IIC Annexe\, India International Centre\, 40 Max M
 ueller Marg\, Lodhi Gardens\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://iicdelhi.in/programmes/exhibition-flux-being
DESCRIPTION:A Solo Exhibition by Ravi Kant Jha\, National award-winning a
 rtist\, his practice investigates themes of consciousness\, memory\, and 
 transformation.\nThe exhibition presents a series of paintings that explo
 re consciousness as a state of constant transformation. Through fluid for
 ms\, layered compositions\, and evocative color fields\, the works blur t
 he boundaries between memory\, imagination\, and reality.\nThe exhibition
  will be inaugurated on Saturday\, 25 July’26 at 17:00 hrs\nThe exhibit
 ion will remain open daily from 11:00 to 19:00 hrs\n\nhttps://iicdelhi.in
 /programmes/exhibition-flux-being
CATEGORIES:exhibition\,art
END:VEVENT
